; ted-wb-info-progfile (#388): started from the Workbench, TED's startup
; code builds "<name>.info" in progfile and clears progfile only after a
; full read of the icon; without a project, outside loads progfile as the
; text.  TED (a copy in work/, no ted.info) started by wbrun like the
; Workbench, without a project.  Correct: TED starts with an empty text;
; the original tries to load "ted.info" and shows its error requester
; (" OKAY ") instead of the editor waiting for input: `wait screen` fails.
; @file run.script "Copy blitz2:ted TEDRUN:work/ted QUIET\nTEDAB:tools/wbrun TEDRUN:work/ted\nDelete TEDRUN:work/ted QUIET\n"
; @source none
; @command Execute TEDRUN:work/run.script
; @expect nolog "OKAY"
timeout 15
wait screen
menu 0 9
wait exit
